{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-qou-exists-axiom-2","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:qou-exists-axiom-2","kind":"lemma","title":"Axiom 2 — the adjoint representation of $\\mathfrak{sl}_2$ has no invariants","proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-qou-exists-axiom-2"],"cites":["references/woronowicz1988"],"tags":["peter-weyl","observability","adjoint-action","compact-quantum-group"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_2_observability","text":"qou-exists-axiom-2.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:qou-exists-axiom-2\"></a><p>For <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{g} = \\mathfrak{sl}_2</code> over a field of characteristic <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\neq 2</code>, the adjoint representation is the irreducible spin-1 representation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V_1</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathbf{1}, V_1) = 0</code>. The statement concerns the adjoint representation of the Lie algebra (or of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">U_q(\\mathfrak{sl}_2)</code> at generic <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>), not the adjoint coaction of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{O}_q(G)</code> on itself, whose invariants are nonzero.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/qou-exists-axiom-2.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"4.8.3","page":"b/lem-qou-exists-axiom-2","qa":{"counts":{"pass":97,"fail":0,"warn":3,"na":19,"unknown":0,"stale":119},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Core.exists_axiom_2_observability","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Core/exists_axiom_2_observability.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
